This source code (the browser client and the server Worker) is made
available so that anyone can read it, audit it, and verify that the client
matches what custodium.space serves to browsers.

Permission is granted, free of charge, to:

  1. View, download, and study this source code.
  2. Run it locally for the purpose of auditing or verifying the service.
  3. Use the file "abrir-offline.html" as distributed inside a Custodium
     export, to open your own encrypted copy.

Open format and standalone opener
---------------------------------

The format of the exported copy (plan.json, paquetes/, archivos/ and the
key derivation they rely on), as specified at https://custodium.space/formato
(public/formato.html in this repository), is dedicated to the public domain
under CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
Anyone may implement it, read it and write it, in any software, for any
purpose, without permission or attribution.

